# The build context is the repo. These would either bloat the image, break it,
# or put something in it that has no business being in an image.

node_modules          # reinstalled inside, for the image's own platform
.git
.env                  # secrets do not go in a layer
data                  # runs.json, uploads, the Chrome profile — the volume's job
.jetstar-profile-cdp  # a local Chrome profile from start-chrome.sh

# Screenshots the shot-* tools write. None of them is input to anything.
*.png

# Records of local runs; the container keeps its own under /data.
runs.json
uploads
created-bookings-*.json

# Docs and scratch that never run inside the image.
*.md
!README.md
